# Files under einoadapter/ permitted to import github.com/cloudwego/eino.
#
# CI diffs this list against reality, so adding an Eino import to a new file fails
# the build until the file is listed here. That makes widening the Eino surface a
# deliberate review event rather than something that happens by accident.
#
# Paths are relative to the module root, sorted, one per line.
#
# The design's earlier criterion — "Eino types appear in exactly one file" — was
# withdrawn because it is not achievable: the conversion, the producer, the approval
# gate, tool dispatch, and both message paths all need Eino types. This list is the
# replacement.
einoadapter/eino-version-guard.go
